The Gazebo Classic package manifest declares BSD. The pinned model
directory has no mesh-specific license text or copyright notice, and
the manifest gives no BSD variant. This record preserves the upstream
declaration and attribution. LICENSE.PX4 contains the separate BSD
3-Clause notice from PX4-Autopilot for the PX4 airframe profile material.

